    p add argument 
         --repo-id  
        type str 
        required help  hugging face repository identifier  e g   user dataset    
     
    p add argument 
         --shard-dir  
        type path 
        default path  rabc shards   
        help  directory read write per-rank parquet shards   
     
    p add argument 
         --logs-dir  
        type path 
        default path  logs   
        help  directory datatrove logs   
     
    p add argument 
         --job-name  
        type str 
        default help  slurm job name  defaults rabc  subcommand     
     
    p add argument 
         --slurm  
        type int 
        default 1 
        help  1   submit via slurm  0   run locally  useful debugging    
     
    p add argument 
         --partition  
        type str 
        default help  slurm partition submit p add argument 
         --cpus-per-task  
        type int 
        default 4 
        help  number cpus per slurm task   
     
    p add argument 
         --mem-per-cpu  
        type str 
        default  4g  
        help  memory per cpu  e g   4g 1950m main   
    parser   argparse argumentparser 
        description  slurm-distributed sarm ra-bc annotation pipeline  
        formatter argparse rawdescriptionhelpformatter 
     
    sub   parser add subparsers dest  command   required cp   sub add parser 
         compute  
        help  distribute progress computation across slurm workers   
     
     add shared args cp 
    cp add argument 
         --reward-model-path  
        type str 
        required help  path hf repo id sarm reward model   
     
    cp add argument 
         --stride  
        type int 
        default 1 
        help  compute every nth frame  intermediate frames interpolated  must 1    
     
    cp add argument 
         --head-mode  
        type str 
        default  sparse  
        choices   sparse    dense    both   
        help reward head s compute   
     
    cp add argument 
         --device  
        type str 
        default  cpu  
        help  device reward model inference  e g   cpu cuda    
     
    cp add argument 
         --workers  
        type int 
        default 50 
        help  number parallel slurm tasks  one shard per worker    
     

     
    ap   sub add parser 
         aggregate  
        help  merge per-rank shards single sarm progress parquet   
     
     add shared args ap 
    ap add argument 
         --reward-model-path  
        type str 
        required help  path hf repo id sarm reward model  stored parquet metadata    
     
    ap add argument 
         --push hub  
        action  store help  upload sarm progress parquet hugging face hub aggregation   
     

